    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>14级 杂兵 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>小型 自然界 类人生物</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 26，''强韧'' 25，''反射'' 24，''意志'' 25</span><span>''侦查'' +5</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 5</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}木棒（武器）✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+19vs.AC<br>命中：14 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">疯狂献祭✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该迪洛矮人暴徒的攻击失手。<br>效果（自由动作）：该攻击改为命中，然后该迪洛矮人暴徒的生命值降为 0。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（迪洛矮人）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 13（+8）</span><span>''敏捷'' 14（+9）</span><span>''感知'' 6（+5）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 18（+11）</span><span>''智力'' 8（+6）</span><span>''魅力'' 16（+10）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 通用语，异怪语</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span style=flex-basis:auto>''装备'' 皮甲，轻盾，木棒</span></div></div>\n</div>",
